FAISS
FAISS is not a complete database. It is primarily a library for efficient similarity search and clustering. Your application must separately manage document storage, metadata, backups and APIs. 
ChromaDB
Chroma stores documents, embeddings and metadata inside collections. It supports local, self-hosted and managed-cloud use, making it beginner-friendly for RAG demonstrations. 
Pinecone
Pinecone is a fully managed vector database designed for production-scale AI workloads. It manages infrastructure, indexing and scaling for the developer. 
Weaviate
Weaviate is an open-source vector database that stores both data objects and their vector embeddings. It supports vector search, metadata filtering and hybrid search. 
Milvus
Milvus is an open-source, cloud-native vector database designed for high-performance similarity search across large vector datasets. It supports deployment from a local application to distributed clusters.
Use ChromaDB for learning, FAISS for custom local search, Pinecone for managed production, Weaviate for feature-rich open-source search and Milvus for large-scale distributed systems.






